<title>USA: FINAL PRICING - Platte Cty School Facilities, Mo..</title>
<headline>FINAL PRICING - Platte Cty School Facilities, Mo..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Edward D. Jones &amp; Co said it priced $3.390 million of Platte County School Facilities Corp, Mo., leasehold revenue school building bonds, with a top yield of 5.40 percent in 2013.</p>
